    "authors_reviews": [
      {
        "position": 1,
        "title": "I didn’t expect to stop checking so quickly",
        "text": "After dealing with inconsistent results from other flea collars for dogs, I got into the habit of checking my dog almost every day. It became part of my routine whether I liked it or not. I tried this flea collar for small dogs expecting more of the same. The first couple of days, I still checked out of habit. But after about a week, I realized I wasn’t thinking about it anymore. My dog seemed comfortable, the collar stayed in place, and nothing felt off. That’s when it hit me—this one actually reduced the mental load. It’s not just about the product itself, it’s about not having to constantly manage it. That’s what made this feel like a real upgrade.",
        "rating": 5,
